// Between Frontiers: countries that may be born after 1925-01-01. Contract:
// crates/bf-sim/src/borders.rs (CandidatesFile); design: docs/borders.pt-BR.md, section 3.
//
// - Every state, territory or new name that came after the 1925 scenario, from Wikidata (P571
//   inception, P576 dissolved, P36 capital and its P625 coordinates; CC0), with the English and
//   Brazilian Portuguese Wikipedia titles for the names (facts only).
// - `states`: the states the reference (data/history/borders.ron) gave the country; for a country
//   the reference never moves a whole state to, the 1925 states whose largest area lies in it.
//   Empty for a country below the map resolution and for a new name (`rename_of`).
// - `color`: picked by data generation to stand apart from the 1925 owners of its states and of
//   their neighbours; `flag`: assets/flags/<TAG>.png from tools/flags/flags_new.csv (free licences,
//   assets/flags/ATTRIBUTION.md).
// - `government` and `laws`: None, the rule of docs/borders.pt-BR.md until part B sets them.
// - Names: assets/i18n/*/countries.ftl (country-<TAG>, .article, country-<TAG>-capital).
// Licence: CC BY-SA 4.0.
